#: 2b43f3559db442859f73a7ed726dd02d
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to “4”. =3."
